# Desktop agents and local tooling are not needed on Vercel.
# Leaving them in the upload can get traced into Function bundles
# and burn Hobby Functions Storage.
#
# IMPORTANT: patterns must be rooted with `/`. A bare `harvest-agent`
# also matches `app/api/harvest-agent/**` and removes those API routes
# from production (imports then 404).
/agent
/harvest-agent
/scripts
/dumps
/tools
/docs
*.md
!README.md
